==Restrictions==
Unit Restriction: Only [[Castle Guard (Rare Cat)|Castle Guard]], [[Castle Horseman (Rare Cat)|Castle Horseman]], [[Ashura (Rare Cat)|Ashura]], [[Battle Balloon (Rare Cat)|Battle Balloon]], [[Dragon Rider (Rare Cat)|Dragon Rider]], [[Pretty Cat (Rare Cat)|Pretty Cat]], [[Cyclops (Rare Cat)|Cyclops]], [[Golem (Special Cat)|Golem]], [[White Swordsman Cat (Special Cat)|White Swordsman Cat]] and [[Li'l Clops Cat Egg (Special Cat)|Li'l Clops Cat Egg]]

==Battleground==
*1 [[4D Cyclops (Enemy)|4D Cyclops]] spawns after 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>.
*2 [[Wise Swordsman (Enemy)|Wise Swordsmen]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*2 [[Kabuki Ashura (Enemy)|Kabuki Ashuras]] spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*5 [[Black Thunder Rider (Enemy)|Black Thunder Riders]] spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Battle UFO (Enemy)|Battle UFO]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Wise Swordsman (Enemy)|Wise Swordsmen]] spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Volcano Golem (Enemy)|Volcano Golem]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*2 [[Cyber Pretty Cat (Enemy)|Cyber Pretty Cats]] spawn after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring any of the [[:Category:Castle & Dragon|Castle & Dragon Cats]] to win, but just make sure you get all the units and their [[True Form]]s before attempting. At higher Crown difficulties, using Catseyes on said units may be needed.

